
>> Animal := Ihe ohuru.
Animal mgbe-ọbịara: ['ohuru'] mee: { <- onwe ohuru init.
}.

Animal mgbe-ọbịara: ['init'] mee: {
	nke-ya sound := ['?'].
	nke-ya legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal ohuru.
Dog mgbe-ọbịara: ['init'] mee: {
	onwe init.
	nke-ya sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal mgbe-ọbịara: ['ederede'] mee: { <- nke-ya legs ederede + nke-ya sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog ohuru.
Mpụta dee: poodle, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.

